error: `xs[^2..]` shares items with `xs[^4..^1]` every time this runs, and a `ref` borrow must be the only one of its items
  --> error_window_always_shared.sg:6:16
 6 |     var high = ref xs[^2..]
   |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  `low` borrowed it here, and is used again later:
  --> error_window_always_shared.sg:5:15
 5 |     var low = ref xs[^4..^1]
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: lend items that do not overlap, as `ref xs[..k]` beside `ref xs[k..]` do
